	(text "Mode 1: S&H is pre-gain2\ngain 1 -> S&H -> gain 2\n[x][x][ ]\n[x][x][ ]\n[x][x][ ]\n\nMode 2: S&H is post gain2\ngain 1 -> gain 2 -> S&H\n[ ][x][x]\n[ ][x][x]\n[ ][x][x]\n\nMode 3: bypass S&H\ngain 1 -> gain 2\n[ ][x][x]\n[ ][ ][ ]\n[x][x][ ]\n\nMode 4: Teensy does not see S&H but SEND does\n[x][x][x]\n[ ][ ][ ]\n[x][x][ ]\n\nMode 5: External audio input with gain\n[ ][ ][ ] <- doesn't matter really\n[x][x][ ]\n[x][x][ ]\n\nMode 5: External audio input without gain\n[ ][ ][ ] <- doesn't matter really\n[ ][x][x]\n[ ][ ][ ] <- doesn't matter really"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 86.106 66.802 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "abcbbc53-997b-474d-b06a-61d5365fb8f2")
	)
	(text "MODE A: Audio out (connect to just send jack - feedback system  works as expected\nMODE B: External In (connect just return jack - feedback path is broken, excite with arbitrary signal)\nMODE C: FX Insert (Or, audio out + external in) (connect send AND return jack - feedback path is broken)\n\nNote: Audio out and FX insert will not work when S&H is bypassed. FX insert is always directly after S&H"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.674 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "be82a7c4-aa46-4878-9a6a-d2a172b90e23")
	)
